From f4a77884666e74407fc4668ab8cb8baf2b23ea0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:09:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add plot_2d / plot_3d / plot_curve graph tools

The model can now draw interactive 2D curves, 3D surfaces / contour maps and
parametric curves (plain chat and agent mode). Formulas are parsed with ast and
run by a small whitelist interpreter (never eval). Figures are stored as
Artifact(kind="plot") and drawn with Plotly.js in the existing sandboxed iframe.

See CHANGES.md ("Graph tools") for the flow, limits and how to extend.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYWF5F9XmDKQWBKKkSuByJ
